[1] atk:atk.setReentrantCall(safeTransferFrom,×1)[ok]→atk:setApprovalForAll(0,False)[ok] | +0.5r +6br | signal=N | desc=N/A
[2] atk:atk.setReentrantCall(highestBid,×2)[ok]→atk:refundBids[fail:Please end the auction firstly] | +0.4r +5br | signal=N | desc=N/A

